-- V0012 defaults of cfg.web.menu_by_role and cfg.app.home_tiles (lead ruling R5, docs/24 s14a; docs/27).
-- menu_by_role: {role: [{menu, page, actions[]}]} derived from the TSO sidebar of docs/19 s5.3, mapped to the roles of
-- docs/24 s8.5 and their capabilities; the pages absent from the TSO manual go to DMO, WM, TOP (read) and the admins
-- (docs/19 D-336). Deferred programmes (docs/27) have no entry: Target, Astha Gift Panel, Astha Web Entry, Campaign
-- Gift Redemption, Discount Report, Superstar Program. The menu only hides entries; the server enforces every action.
-- home_tiles: the SR tile order of docs/ui-reference/sr/home.md without Loyalty Point and Photo Capture (R5) and
-- without Astha (docs/27 rule 6: no UI for deferred items). Roles without an entry use the app's built-in default.

